### herdr pane send-keys --help
Send key presses to a pane

Usage: herdr pane send-keys <PANE_ID> <KEY>...

Arguments:
  <PANE_ID>
          

  <KEY>...
          

Use esc as the canonical Escape key name; escape is also accepted.

